   "h": "Algorithm Vomiting — intracranial/pericranial vs extracranial",
   "html": "<figure><img src=\"symp/img/yb-3-3-f1.webp\" alt=\"Algorithm Vomiting แยกสาเหตุ intracranial/pericranial และ extracranial\"><figcaption>3.3 Vomiting — เล่มเหลือง</figcaption></figure><div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y33a\"></div>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "cause",
   "html": "<p><b>เล่มเหลือง</b> — Vomiting</p><ul><li><b>Intracranial and Pericranial</b><ul><li>Brain — Increase ICP \"น้ำ-เลือด-เนื้อ-หนอง\": <b>น้ำ</b> hydrocephalus · <b>เลือด</b> ICH, SDH, SAH · <b>เนื้อ</b> Tumor · <b>หนอง</b> Meningitis, encephalitis · <b>idiopathic</b> Pseudotumor cerebri</li><li>Vestibular — Labyrinthitis, Motion sickness</li><li>Eye — Glaucoma</li></ul></li><li><b>Extracranial</b><ul><li>GU — Pyelonephritis, Stone, PID, Pregnancy</li><li>Metabolic — Endo: AI, DKA · Nephro: Uremia, Na↓</li><li>Drug & toxin — Drug: Chemo, Opioid, NSAID, ATB · Toxin: Organophosphate</li></ul></li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "acute-gi",
   "html": "<p><b>เล่มเหลือง</b> — GI organic \"Obstruct-Inflam\": <b>Obstruction</b> (Gastric outlet, Small bowel) · <b>Inflammation</b> (Stomach: PU, Food poisoning · Hep-Bili: Hepatitis, Cholecystitis · Pancreas: Pancreatitis · Bowel: AGE, Peritonitis, appendicitis) · Functional: IBS, Gastroparesis</p>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "acute-drug",
   "html": "<p><b>เล่มเหลือง</b> — Drug & toxin: Chemo, Opioid, NSAID, ATB · Toxin: Organophosphate</p>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "acute-vn",
   "html": "<p><b>เล่มเหลือง</b> — Vestibular: Labyrinthitis, Motion sickness</p>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "chr-gp",
   "html": "<p><b>เล่มเหลือง</b> — GI functional: IBS, Gastroparesis</p>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "chr-goo",
   "html": "<p><b>เล่มเหลือง</b> — GI obstruction: Gastric outlet, Small bowel</p>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "chr-preg",
   "html": "<p><b>เล่มเหลือง</b> — GU: Pregnancy (อยู่ในกลุ่ม GU ร่วมกับ Pyelonephritis, Stone, PID)</p>"
